On June 21, 2024 3:45:51 AM Jacobe Zang <jacobe.zang@wesion.com> wrote:

> Hello,
>
>> Where is the binding for this?
> I seperate the binding in this patch " [PATCH v1 1/3] arm64: dts: rockchip: 
